      "id": "splits_note",
      "title": "Note",
      "rootType": "note",
      "isNote": true,
      "noteText": "Shakes the reels on frame 12 of the character's split/splitSTART. Character-split plays that animation the moment symbols split (symbolsSplitting), and it runs at 30 fps, so frame 12 is 0.4 s later. ReelArea holds the frame, its WIN/WAYS texts and the symbols, so they shake together and spring back to where the layout put them."
